{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/犯者必诛","pageid":9229,"revid":22518,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8A%AF%E8%80%85%E5%BF%85%E8%AF%9B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8A%AF%E8%80%85%E5%BF%85%E8%AF%9B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8A%AF%E8%80%85%E5%BF%85%E8%AF%9B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>犯者必诛</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.8A.AF.E8.80.85.E5.BF.85.E8.AF.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"犯者必诛\"><b>犯者必诛</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 犯者必诛.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/48/l7ec74qn4bf1smc099m1k10huveomxc.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8A%AF%E8%80%85%E5%BF%85%E8%AF%9B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/48/l7ec74qn4bf1smc099m1k10huveomxc.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8A%AF%E8%80%85%E5%BF%85%E8%AF%9B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/48/l7ec74qn4bf1smc099m1k10huveomxc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />犯者必诛\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）被攻击时，若攻击者所在方向的<font color=\"#ed7950\">3*4</font>区域存在敌人，则进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"震慑反击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">震慑反击</font></span></span>]，对范围内敌人造成物攻值<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>的穿透范围伤害；且反击前对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透易伤2</font></span></span>]，持续2回合，每回合最多触发1次（可消耗[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"反击战意\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">反击战意</font></span></span>]以额外触发）。携带技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">枪锋屹立</span>]时，本技能攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">35%</font>。<br />✦主动攻击后，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤2</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），并对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"被讽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">被讽</font></span></span>]，持续1回合，若命中多个目标则最多施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次。<br />✦自身每拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"特定防御类增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">特定防御类增益</font></span></span>]，防御额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">2%</font>，最多提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7%E2%80%A2%E5%AF%92%E9%94%8B%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93\" title=\"角色图鉴库/列奥尼德•寒锋血誓\"><img alt=\"头像 列奥尼德•寒锋血誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5e/psmyam389hualjbfd0utgnbr2hnjsbo.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">列奥尼德•寒锋血誓</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"枪锋屹立\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9E%AA%E9%94%8B%E5%B1%B9%E7%AB%8B\" title=\"技能图鉴库/枪锋屹立\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/105px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%